# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">SAĞLIKLI BESLENME VE ÖĞÜNLER (الْغِذَاءُ الصِّحِّيُّ وَالْوَجَبَاتُ)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">SAĞLIKLI GIDALAR (الْأَطْعِمَةُ الْمُفِيدَةُ)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• الْغِذَاءُ الصِّحِّيُّ : Sağlıklı besin / gıda</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• الْخَضْرَوَاتُ وَالْفَوَاكِهُ : Sebzeler ve meyveler</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• الْحَلِيبُ وَالْعَسَلُ : Süt ve bal</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• اللَّحْمُ وَالسَّمَكُ وَالْبَيْضُ : Et, balık ve yumurta</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• الْوَجَبَاتُ الْيَوْمِيَّةُ : Günlük öğünler (فَطُور، غَدَاء، عَشَاء)</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fef2f2" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#991b1b">ZARARLI ALIŞKANLIKLAR (الْعَادَاتُ الضَّارَّةُ)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• الْوَجَبَاتُ السَّرِيعَةُ : Hazır yemekler (Fast food)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• الْمَشْرُوبَاتُ الْغَازِيَّةُ : Gazlı içecekler</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• السُّكَّرِيَّاتُ وَالدُّهُونُ : Şekerli ve yağlı gıdalar</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• السَّهَرُ الطَّوِيلُ : Gece geç saatlere kadar uyanık kalmak</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• قِلَّةُ الْحَرَكَةِ / الْكَسَلُ : Hareketsizlik / Tembellik</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Dengeli beslenme (التَّغْذِيَةُ الْمُتَوَازِنَةُ) beden ve zihin sağlığını korumanın temel şartıdır.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">GEREKLİLİK VE YASAKLAMA KALIPLARI (يَجِبُ أَنْ ... / لَا تَفْعَلْ ...)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">GEREKLİLİK KALIPLARI (يَجِبُ عَلَيْكَ أَنْ + مُضَارِع مَنْصُوب)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• يَجِبُ عَلَيْكَ أَنْ تَغْسِلَ يَدَيْكَ : Ellerini yıkaman gerekir</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• يَجِبُ أَنْ تَنَامَ مُبَكِّرًا : Erken uyuman gerekir</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• يَجِبُ أَنْ تَتَنَاوَلَ الْفَطُورَ : Kahvaltı yapman gerekir</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• يَجِبُ أَنْ تُمَارِسَ الرِّيَاضَةَ : Spor yapman gerekir</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• يَجِبُ أَنْ تُنَظِّفَ أَسْنَانَكَ : Dişlerini fırçalaman gerekir</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">NEHİY (YASAKLAMA) VE SIKLIK SORULARI</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• لَا تَأْكُلْ كَثِيرًا مِنَ الْحَلْوَى : Çok tatlı yeme!</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• لَا تَشْرَبِ الْمَشْرُوبَاتِ الْغَازِيَّةَ : Gazlı içecek içme!</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• كَمْ مَرَّةً تُنَظِّفُ أَسْنَانَكَ فِي الْيَوْمِ؟ : Günde kaç kez...?</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• مَرَّتَيْنِ / ثَلَاثَ مَرَّاتٍ فِي الْيَوْمِ : Günde iki / üç kez</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• قَبْلَ الطَّعَامِ وَبَعْدَهُ : Yemekten önce ve sonra</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">أَنْ edatı muzari fiili nasbeder (sonunu fetha yapar); لَا النَّاهِيَةُ ise muzari fiili cezmeder (sükûn yapar).</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">DOKTOR - HASTA VE ECZANE DİYALOG UYGULAMALARI</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">KLİNİK VE ECZANE İFADELERİ</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• فَحَصَ الطَّبِيبُ الْمَرِيضَ : Doktor hastayı muayene etti</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• كَتَبَ الطَّبِيبُ الْوَصْفَةَ الطِّبِّيَّةَ : Doktor reçeteyi yazdı</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• اِشْتَرَيْتُ الدَّوَاءَ مِنَ الصَّيْدَلِيَّةِ : Eczaneden ilacı aldım</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• خُذْ هٰذَا الْمُسَكِّنَ بَعْدَ الْغَدَاءِ : Bu ağrı kesiciyi öğleden sonra al</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• شَفَاكَ اللّٰهُ / لَا دَاعِيَ لِلْقَلَقِ : Allah şifa versin / Endişelenme</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#ecfdf5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#065f46">KİŞİSEL HİJYEN VE TEMİZLİK İLKELERİ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• فُرْشَاةُ الْأَسْنَانِ وَالْمَعْجُونُ : Diş fırçası ve macunu</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• أَغْسِلُ يَدَيَّ بِالْمَاءِ وَالصَّابُونِ : Ellerimi su ve sabunla yıkarım</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• اَلنَّظَافَةُ تَحْمِي الْإِنْسَانَ مِنَ الْأَمْرَاضِ : Temizlik hastalıktan korur</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• اَلْعَقْلُ السَّلِيمُ فِي الْجِسْمِ السَّلِيمِ : Sağlam kafa sağlam vücutta</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• اَلطُّهُورُ شَطْرُ الْإِيمَانِ : Temizlik imanın yarısıdır</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Günlük diyaloglarda hem fiziksel tedavi hem de koruyucu sağlık tavsiyeleri bir arada kullanılır.</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get("bolumler", [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b["gorsel"] = SVGS[i]
